{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】不是你的 N 卡壞了 !! NVIDIA 21 日釋出的 GeForce 621.01 WHQL 顯示卡驅動程式，推出不久便陸續傳出穩定性異常回報，安裝後會出現無預警黑屏、驅動程式崩潰，以及 Windows 事件檢視器中頻繁跳出「nvlddmkm Event ID 153」等錯誤。</p><p>由於多項遊戲與效能控制功能亦傳出異常，建議目前系統運作正常的玩家先維持現有版本，暫緩升級以避免影響日常使用體驗。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T02:45:24.497688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:25:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:57:59.887737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:38:15.139342+00:00","content_hash":"4926914a27eb1f1485901efde8678547edccce7cbf55e832dd426e9ee8e80d5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}